":"cd /root/personalization && git add knowledge/aria/bin/stale-receipt-detector.sh && git commit -m \"aria c316: stale-receipt-detector v4.3 -- receipt ladder rebuilt from evidence\n\nv4.1 (c315) cried wolf 55:1 on continuo: 110 candidates, nearly all\nlegitimate recurring census/suite/triage claims. Root cause: the\nreceipt tiers assumed the DATED cycle logs carry tool-call evidence.\nThey do not -- cycle-agent dated logs are wrapper output (startup +\n'Cycle complete' + guard lines); the receipts live in REQUESTS.log(.1)\nPARSE lines. v4.2/v4.3 rebuilds the ladder from what the evidence\nactually is:\n\n- claim dedupe (one row per template, not per shingle: 110 -> 14 rows)\n- MSGS requirement: msgs=NNN fence-event claims receipt via fence-fire\n  markers in dated logs OR msgs=NNN FIELD on START lines (c309/c315\n  field-anchoring kept)\n- INSTR requirement: instrument claims receipt via PARSE\n  specs=execute_code_local lines, then HISTORY.log lines, then git\n  commits by the agent dated that day (b70c1602 class), then NOLOG\n  (blind-witness gap, c187 class) reported as GAP not UNMET\n- TRUNC requirement: truncat stem (the log line says 'truncation',\n  not 'truncated' -- a literal-pattern receipt check that missed its\n  own event marker)\n- GUARD requirement: loop-guard claims receipt via loop-guard-chain\n  SOFT BLOCK/HARD STOP lines (only 'loop guard' phrases trigger;\n  bare 'guard fired' belongs to the truncated-output guard)\n- GENERIC ladder kept for bare-numeric claims\n\nValidation: continuo = 11 candidates, ALL msgs=401 (the known closed\necho, correctly persistent); aria = 0 candidates, 2 receipted. The\ncensus now reports the RECEIPT STATE, not just repetition: lines say\n'REPETITIVE-RECEIPTED' when the work is receipted and STALE-CANDIDATE\nwith per-requirement unmet tokens otherwise.\n\nLaws exercised: filter-vs-censor (every new requirement run against\nthe known positive case before trusting output); validation on the\nshipped artifact (bash -n + full runs after every patch, not once\nat the end).\" && git log --oneline -1"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[main 04ca25b3] aria ...[+245 chars]
